        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CK-1118, 1-1/4 Inch Diameter Simple Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis RK International made cabinet pull features an easy, screw-on installation. With a 1-1/4 Inch Diameter, this Simple Cabinet Knob is an elegant way to improve the style of any home. What is great about the Simple Cabinet Knob is its classic shape and 7 available finishes to choose from that allow you to be able to add it to most any decor. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CK-1118 Thin Mushroom Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
